ote:\n\nHarry wrote: it was only for demonstration purposes, i wont do it again, i promise\n\nHey Harry,\n\nI know about CP. The point is to watch for CP when approaching supply or demand, right? But you don't have to see CP, right? You can wait for price to enter a zone and then engulf showing prices intention on falling. In the chart below price entered the zone with no CP and still fell.","a":"Hotochin","d":"","n":"#791","p":32,"im":["153c1c5fdcaad73e0295e96d6fb27c6b97d1cf7a"],"m":791},{"id":"aboutcompression_p32_792","t":"Harry wrote: lol, i'm just joking mate. you are doing fine. a big \"Thank You\" from me to Les_Paul and Benhur for picking these up and helping a new member.\n\ni wonder are we the only 3 who know about compression???\n\nThere should be more and sorry to those that I din't mention While I doing all homeworks, I notice 3 of you always give feedback.","a":"boy2boy","d":"","n":"#792","p":32,"im":[],"m":792},{"id":"aboutcompression_p32_793","t":"Hi,\n\nPossible?","a":"boy2boy","d":"","n":"#793","p":32,"im":["763874affd4a90d952e7a59e9d671689ff2cf746"],"m":793},{"id":"aboutcompression_p32_794","t":"Hi,\n\nWhat will happen next??","a":"boy2boy","d":"","n":"#794","p":32,"im":["24e078a2da9dbcf504fdb8aee5a31d6771cb82fd"],"m":794},{"id":"aboutcompression_p32_795","t":"boy2boy wrote: Hi,\n\nWhat will happen next??","a":"Les_Paul","d":"","n":"#795","p":32,"im":["24e078a2da9dbcf504fdb8aee5a31d6771cb82fd","6dbb6f68748705315d976a11b5a4deb9364a9d2e"],"m":795},{"id":"aboutcompression_p32_796","t":"boy2boy wrote: Hi,\n\nWhat will happen next??\n\nFailed","a":"boy2boy","d":"","n":"#796","p":32,"im":["24e078a2da9dbcf504fdb8aee5a31d6771cb82fd","aae2a9f4ab7604126b3ba85b1363136aa9536127"],"m":796},{"id":"aboutcompression_p32_797","t":"Les_Paul wrote:\n\nIt is mean that, if the price do not respect the S/D with the 1st touch and reverse, it means that price would like to go beyond it?","a":"boy2boy","d":"","n":"#797","p":32,"im":["6dbb6f68748705315d976a11b5a4deb9364a9d2e"],"m":797},{"id":"aboutcompression_p32_798","t":"boy2boy wrote: It is mean that, if the price do not respect the S/D with the 1st touch and reverse, it means that price would like to go beyond it?\n\nDear boy2boy,\n\ndo yourself a favour and read Markepedia carefully\n\nLes_Paul","a":"Les_Paul","d":"","n":"#798","p":32,"im":[],"m":798},{"id":"aboutcompression_p32_799","t":"Hi LP,\n\nSorry if I've caused you any inconvenient","a":"boy2boy","d":"","n":"#799","p":32,"im":[],"m":799},{"id":"aboutcompression_p32_800","t":"boy2boy wrote: Hi LP,\n\nSorry if I've caused you any inconvenient\n\nOh, definitely not! Maybe it sounded too harsh but it was not my intention (I am not native speaker). Sorry for that! I will be happy to help you anytime...!\n\nIt was just a recommendation to learn the very basics and Markepedia is a great source of education...\n\nLes_Paul","a":"Les_Paul","d":"","n":"#800","p":32,"im":[],"m":800}],"images":[{"k":"523c65b7c34855fe1f0959f5e396b9b6ca3cf43c","t":"assets/thumbs/523c65b7c34855fe1f0959f5e396b9b6ca3cf43c.webp","f":"assets/images/523c65b7c34855fe1f0959f5e396b9b6ca3cf43c.png","w":1263,"h":629,"b":19530,"o":"523c65b7c34855fe1f0959f5e396b9b6ca3cf43c.png","p":32,"pid":"aboutcompression_p32_780"},{"k":"c0e0b3ca665eb7b31c4c0e684d6961dbff44518f","t":"assets/thumbs/c0e0b3ca665eb7b31c4c0e684d6961dbff44518f.webp","f":"assets/images/c0e0b3ca665eb7b31c4c0e684d6961dbff44518f.png","w":1263,"h":629,"b":21442,"o":"c0e0b3ca665eb7b31c4c0e684d6961dbff44518f.png","p":32,"pid":"aboutcompression_p32_781"},{"k":"9b7e5a688ce7ad5db634457cf442d0f75e3a4ab9","t":"assets/thumbs/9b7e5a688ce7ad5db634457cf442d0f75e3a4ab9.webp","f":"assets/images/9b7e5a688ce7ad5db634457cf442d0f75e3a4ab9.png","w":1263,"h":629,"b":22738,"o":"9b7e5a688ce7ad5db634457cf442d0f75e3a4ab9.png","p":32,"pid":"aboutcompression_p32_776"},{"k":"67dd60c98c65d4719a3f85fb18249b5862ef1214","t":"assets/thumbs/67dd60c98c65d4719a3f85fb18249b5862ef1214.webp","f":"assets/images/67dd60c98c65d4719a3f85fb18249b58